OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGroup entered hotel of cricketers
OL,4,Amistaken for migrants
OL,5,
OL,6,FSumair Syed, chief operating officer of
OL,7,Fthe Pakistan Cricket Board, said the
OL,8,Fteam reported people "knocking on their
OL,9,Fdoors" during the incident, but the
OL,10,Fplayers "behaved responsibly and didn't
OL,11,Fescalate the situation".
OL,13,FHampshire Police said officers found no
OL,14,Foffences had been committed, and the
OL,15,Fcrowd dispersed by about 21:00 BST.
